cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use AgentKernelArena in research, please cite the paper listed under
  preferred-citation. Report the repository revision, task selection, hardware
  and evaluation configuration with your results.
title: AgentKernelArena
type: software
abstract: >-
  An RL-ready environment for evaluating GPU kernel optimization agents with
  isolated workspaces, gated compilation, correctness and performance checks,
  centralized scoring and held-out generalization testing.
